jEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"195\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x195.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork - Italy\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x195.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-580x565.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x935.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-768x748.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9506\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/italy_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,974\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork – Italy\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x935.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/germany_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTg5IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE4OSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"189\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x189.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork - Germany\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x189.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-580x548.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x906.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-768x725.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9404\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/germany_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,944\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork – Germany\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x906.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/france_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork - France\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-580x573.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x948.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-768x759.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9308\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/france_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,988\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork – France\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x948.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork - USA\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-580x574.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x949.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-768x760.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10231\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,989\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork – USA\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x949.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"197\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x197.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork - Netherlands\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x197.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-580x572.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x947.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-768x757.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9796\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,986\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork – Netherlands\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x947.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>Track one of the eight-track tape contained Starr’s drums, while the second and third featured Harrison’s guide vocals and electric guitar respectively. <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a>’s piano part was recorded on track four.</p><p>A range of overdubs were then added to take four. McCartney’s bass guitar part and another guitar part by Harrison were recorded on track six. Harrison then added lead vocals to track two, with backing from Lennon and McCartney.</p><p>Additional backing vocals by Lennon and McCartney were then recorded on track five. All of the vocals parts were intentionally distorted by studio engineer Jeff Jarratt.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-old-brown-shoe_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-108851\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iNzk2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDc5NiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"108851\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-old-brown-shoe_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-old-brown-shoe_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"800,796\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"George Harrison&amp;#8217;s handwritten lyrics for Old Brown Shoe\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-old-brown-shoe_01.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/lyrics-old-brown-shoe_01.jpg\" alt=\"George Harrison's handwritten lyrics for Old Brown Shoe\" width=\"800\" height=\"796\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-108851\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-old-brown-shoe_01.jpg 800w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-old-brown-shoe_01-580x577.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-old-brown-shoe_01-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-old-brown-shoe_01-768x764.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-old-brown-shoe_01-66x66.jpg 66w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>With work on ‘Old Brown Shoe’ finished for the night, The Beatles began work on Harrison’s most celebrated Beatles song, <a href=\"/songs/something/\">‘Something’</a>. This, too, had been demoed on 25 February, and had been played during the <a href=\"/features/get-back-let-it-be-sessions-complete-song-list/\"><em>Get Back</em>/<em>Let It Be</em> sessions</a> on <a href=\"/1969/01/28/get-back-let-it-be-sessions-day-19/\">28</a> and <a href=\"/1969/01/29/get-back-let-it-be-sessions-day-20/\">29 January</a>.</p><p>The Beatles taped 13 instrumental takes in this initial session, with Harrison on rhythm guitar, Paul McCartney on drums, Lennon on bass guitar, and <a href=\"/people/george-martin/\">George Martin</a> on piano. The recording was later abandoned in favour of a remake on <a href=\"/1969/05/02/recording-something/\">2 May 1969</a>.</p><p>Before the session ended at 2.45am, three stereo mixes of ‘Old Brown Shoe’ were made. None of them was used, and further overdubs were added on <a href=\"/1969/04/18/recording-mixing-old-brown-shoe-i-want-you-shes-so-heavy/\">18 April 1969</a>.</p>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 1 July 2024</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2024: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2024/04/16/restored-let-it-be-film-coming-to-disney-plus/\">Restored Let It Be film coming to Disney+</a></li><li>2021: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2021/04/16/album-release-mccartney-iii-imagined-paul-mccartney/\">Album release: McCartney III Imagined by Paul McCartney</a></li><li>2002: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2002/04/16/paul-mccartney-live-wells-fargo-center-philadelphia/\">Paul McCartney live: Wells Fargo Center, Philadelphia</a></li><li>1993: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1993/04/16/paul-mccartney-live-hollywood-bowl-los-angeles/\">Paul McCartney live: Hollywood Bowl, Los Angeles</a></li><li>1973: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1973/04/16/mixing-wings-over-europe-tour/\">Mixing: Wings Over Europe Tour</a></li><li>1973: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1973/04/16/interview-john-lennon-yoko-ono-elliot-mintz/\">Interview: John Lennon and Yoko Ono by Elliot Mintz</a></li><li>1971: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1971/04/16/mixing-ram-paul-linda-mccartney-5/\">Mixing: Ram by Paul and Linda McCartney</a></li><li>1966: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1966/04/16/recording-mixing-rain/\">Recording, mixing: Rain</a></li><li>1965: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/04/16/television-ready-steady-go-4/\">Television: Ready, Steady, Go!</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/04/16/recording-a-hard-days-night/\">Recording: A Hard Day’s Night</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/04/16/filming-a-hard-days-night-33/\">Filming: A Hard Day’s Night</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/04/16/television-scene-at-6-30/\">Television: Scene At 6.30</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/04/16/live-star-club-hamburg-4/\">The Beatles live: Star-Club, Hamburg</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/04/16/live-top-ten-club-hamburg-16/\">The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, Hamburg</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div><div class=\"gm-map\" style=\"position: relative;height: 390px; width: 100%;\"><iframe data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"about:blank\" name=\"gm-map-1\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?geo_mashup_content=render-map&amp;map_data_key=407c154ccec8fc63ae1fbba1c79801d1&amp;height=390&amp;width=100%&amp;add_overview_control=false&amp;zoom=16&amp;enable_street_view=false&amp;map_type=G_HYBRID_MAP&amp;name=gm-map-1&amp;object_id=6714&amp;map_content=single\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; overflow: hidden;\" title=\"Geo Mashup Map\"></iframe></div>",
  "textContent": "Studio Three, EMI Studios, Abbey Road\nProducer: George Martin\nEngineer: Jeff JarrattJohn Lennon and Paul McCartney had recorded ‘The Ballad Of John And Yoko’ on 14 April 1969. Two days later, three of The Beatles met at Abbey Road to record its b-side, George Harrison’s song ‘Old Brown Shoe’. There were two separate sessions on this day. From 2.30-5pm Harrison recorded a solo demo of ‘Old Brown Shoe’ in a single take.He had previously demoed the song on 25 February 1969. On this day, however, his demo was recorded over once The Beatles’ session began at 7pm. It is likely that Harrison played the recording to them for reference before work began.Although Ringo Starr was busy filming The Magic Christian during this period, he did perform drums during this session.The Beatles recorded the backing track for ‘Old Brown Shoe’ in just four takes, although the first was incomplete. Take two was included on some formats of the 50th anniversary reissue of Abbey Road. Take four, meanwhile, became the basis of the single version.\n\n\n\n\n\nTrack one of the eight-track tape contained Starr’s drums, while the second and third featured Harrison’s guide vocals and electric guitar respectively. John Lennon’s piano part was recorded on track four.A range of overdubs were then added to take four. McCartney’s bass guitar part and another guitar part by Harrison were recorded on track six. Harrison then added lead vocals to track two, with backing from Lennon and McCartney.Additional backing vocals by Lennon and McCartney were then recorded on track five. All of the vocals parts were intentionally distorted by studio engineer Jeff Jarratt.With work on ‘Old Brown Shoe’ finished for the night, The Beatles began work on Harrison’s most celebrated Beatles song, ‘Something’. This, too, had been demoed on 25 February, and had been played during the Get Back/Let It Be sessions on 28 and 29 January.The Beatles taped 13 instrumental takes in this initial session, with Harrison on rhythm guitar, Paul McCartney on drums, Lennon on bass guitar, and George Martin on piano. The recording was later abandoned in favour of a remake on 2 May 1969.Before the session ended at 2.45am, three stereo mixes of ‘Old Brown Shoe’ were made. None of them was used, and further overdubs were added on 18 April 1969.\nPage last updated: 1 July 2024Also on this day...2024: Restored Let It Be film coming to Disney+2021: Album release: McCartney III Imagined by Paul McCartney2002: Paul McCartney live: Wells Fargo Center, Philadelphia1993: Paul McCartney live: Hollywood Bowl, Los Angeles1973: Mixing: Wings Over Europe Tour1973: Interview: John Lennon and Yoko Ono by Elliot Mintz1971: Mixing: Ram by Paul and Linda McCartney1966: Recording, mixing: Rain1965: Television: Ready, Steady, Go!1964: Recording: A Hard Day’s Night1964: Filming: A Hard Day’s Night1963: Television: Scene At 6.301962: The Beatles live: Star-Club, Hamburg1961: The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, HamburgWant more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
